# SecureAudit hashes file bytes in several places that must agree across
# machines: the research study's sha256.json, the catalog digest in scan
# evidence contexts, and the catalog signature manifest. If a Windows
# checkout silently converts LF to CRLF, every one of those hashes
# changes even though no content changed. Pin line endings so a
# checkout is byte-identical on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
